'' WRITE and PRINT USING send a ustring item -- a variable, a field, a 'ustring * N', a
'' chain, a call, a property -- to fb_WriteUStr / fb_PrintUsingUStr, and a ustring FORMAT
'' through fb_UStrToStr first. Every one of them used to go out as narrow bytes and print
'' its first character. See the source for fbc's output.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/mir/src/ustr-write-using.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: verify: ok
'' EXPECT-OUT: 0 statements not lowered
'' EXPECT-OUT: fb_WriteUStr(
'' EXPECT-OUT: fb_PrintUsingUStr(
'' EXPECT-OUT: fb_UStrToStr(
''  (fb_WriteString and fb_PrintUsingStr DO appear: the narrow items beside them.)
'' EXPECT-NOT: func.addr
